Keep engineering knowledge inspectable through evidence, versions, and transfers of work (@mine-knowledge: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @mining-and-mineral-engineering, #source "../../../inquiry/reproducible-computation/Reproducible-computation.lingua#r_78FWWJDCV0ZGG7VYSPRCWN56DQ", #source "../../../inquiry/metrology/Metrology.lingua#r_3G54ENPA974K19AB5XF0P641N5", #source "../sources/Resource-and-Reserve-Reporting-CRIRSCO-CBRR.lingua#r_2CZZ64T1W8VC542VCNCH2E6DSR", #mining-and-mineral-engineering "../research/A-sustained-mining-and-mineral-engineering-programme.lingua#r_1XQHJ15KB0BTJ9Z0GBXT5F2W6P") { r_1PY7QJ9AZSW05BY0HY2HNWND5T
**Read:** [Reproducible computational work](../../../inquiry/reproducible-computation/Reproducible-computation.lingua#r_78FWWJDCV0ZGG7VYSPRCWN56DQ), reuse versioned environments, reproducible workflows, independent tests, and preservation; [Measurement and metrology](../../../inquiry/metrology/Metrology.lingua#r_3G54ENPA974K19AB5XF0P641N5), reuse traceability, measurement models, method validation, and records; [Resources, reserves, and technical-study definitions — CRIRSCO and CBRR](../sources/Resource-and-Reserve-Reporting-CRIRSCO-CBRR.lingua#r_2CZZ64T1W8VC542VCNCH2E6DSR), the full relevant technical-study and supporting-evidence definitions.

Distinguish a public principle, an empirical relation calibrated on a stated population, a supplier's claim, a confidential operating detail, and an unresolved question. Unknown or inaccessible knowledge is a real gap; do not replace it with a confident invented design. Explain what can be derived from available evidence and what would require measurement, experiment, or authorized professional information.

Preserve geological/sample identity, methods, units, time/reference frames, calibration, source editions, model/code versions, assumptions, raw observations, revisions, and links to decisions. This allows another person to investigate a discrepancy instead of inheriting only a final number. Protect actual confidential and personal information while recording the public basis and limits of a learning case.

Operational understanding also includes tacit skills, failure experience, inspections, repair, and interpretation. A drawing or manual supports that work but does not prove that a new team can perform it. Explain demonstrations and observations needed for a transfer of responsibility, with unresolved differences retained.

**Work:** choose one important decision in the selected case and produce an inspectable evidence chain from observations through calculation, alternatives, decision, and later monitoring. Have another reader reproduce a numerical result and challenge one assumption from the cited material. Record the disagreement and revise the explanation if the evidence changes. Keep external books, data, and proprietary material at their authorized sources; author only the original explanations and calculations needed to connect them.

**Continue:** [Complete a sustained mining and processing programme with derivations and applied work](../research/A-sustained-mining-and-mineral-engineering-programme.lingua#r_1XQHJ15KB0BTJ9Z0GBXT5F2W6P).

**Return:** [Mining and mineral engineering — extraction, processing, and continuing work](../Mining-and-mineral-engineering.lingua#r_22HJPS3RTK5EX1J55YJP75PHYA).
